{"chunk_id":"kinexushhd_alerts_008","app":"KINEXUSHHD","domain":"alerts","type":"text","text":"Never use the kinexus HHD Portal as the only method of making clinical decisions, monitoring, or communicating with the patient. Risk of poor therapy outcomes.","image_path":null,"section":"Warnings","page":9,"keywords":["clinical decision","not only method","risk","therapy outcome","monitoring","communication","warning","safety"]}
